{"3838200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashore & Away", "steam_appid": 3838200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashore &amp; Away</strong> is a vibrant open-world adventure that throws you into the unpredictable heart of the Bermuda Triangle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a rich mystery and storyline. How and when you engage with it is completely up to you. Sail in any direction, tackle challenges in any order, and discover your own unique way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/6a471df35204dcd80c374c69c1683f84.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/badd23a629d57d0173bed78e93ea9b17.poster.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/badd23a629d57d0173bed78e93ea9b17.webm?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/badd23a629d57d0173bed78e93ea9b17.mp4?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the seas using a mysterious compass that reacts to the world around you. Scan the empty horizon, follow the needle's oscillations, and watch as uncharted islands literally rise from the ocean depths as you approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/f073f4d8a2195569e6c77d952d68aa05.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/f8b1e793f5e1deafc08f27321312151a.poster.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/f8b1e793f5e1deafc08f27321312151a.webm?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/f8b1e793f5e1deafc08f27321312151a.mp4?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a robust set of actions (Walk / Run, Jump / Fall, Climb, Swim, Glide, Fish) and interaction features, overcome your environment, solve puzzles and progress along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/bea1cb37dc259af3d1cdbb567cb7f56a.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/421647d17f203b01b40b1d01448eb906.poster.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/421647d17f203b01b40b1d01448eb906.webm?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/421647d17f203b01b40b1d01448eb906.mp4?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment, find stranded crew, help out others along the way and prepare to defend yourself against the dangers that might lurk on the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/ab6c4fa1e96ee04b99d08dcf4ff0eb74.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/95a76a7005012b0fe05204850126d523.poster.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/95a76a7005012b0fe05204850126d523.webm?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/95a76a7005012b0fe05204850126d523.mp4?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge resources by chopping, digging, mining, or gathering. Yet another means to help you craft your gear and repair your raft with a simple crafting system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, the choice is yours; play at your own pace and explore however you like.  Stay Ashore or sail Away and venture out into the unknown! Ultimately, your escape depends on your wits, your raft, and the hidden knowledge of the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you make your way back home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashore &amp; Away</strong> is a vibrant open-world adventure that throws you into the unpredictable heart of the Bermuda Triangle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a rich mystery and storyline. How and when you engage with it is completely up to you. Sail in any direction, tackle challenges in any order, and discover your own unique way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/6a471df35204dcd80c374c69c1683f84.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/badd23a629d57d0173bed78e93ea9b17.poster.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/badd23a629d57d0173bed78e93ea9b17.webm?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/badd23a629d57d0173bed78e93ea9b17.mp4?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the seas using a mysterious compass that reacts to the world around you. Scan the empty horizon, follow the needle's oscillations, and watch as uncharted islands literally rise from the ocean depths as you approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/f073f4d8a2195569e6c77d952d68aa05.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/f8b1e793f5e1deafc08f27321312151a.poster.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/f8b1e793f5e1deafc08f27321312151a.webm?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/f8b1e793f5e1deafc08f27321312151a.mp4?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a robust set of actions (Walk / Run, Jump / Fall, Climb, Swim, Glide, Fish) and interaction features, overcome your environment, solve puzzles and progress along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/bea1cb37dc259af3d1cdbb567cb7f56a.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/421647d17f203b01b40b1d01448eb906.poster.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/421647d17f203b01b40b1d01448eb906.webm?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/421647d17f203b01b40b1d01448eb906.mp4?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment, find stranded crew, help out others along the way and prepare to defend yourself against the dangers that might lurk on the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/ab6c4fa1e96ee04b99d08dcf4ff0eb74.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1560 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/95a76a7005012b0fe05204850126d523.poster.avif?t=1785003939\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/95a76a7005012b0fe05204850126d523.webm?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/extras/95a76a7005012b0fe05204850126d523.mp4?t=1785003939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge resources by chopping, digging, mining, or gathering. Yet another means to help you craft your gear and repair your raft with a simple crafting system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, the choice is yours; play at your own pace and explore however you like.  Stay Ashore or sail Away and venture out into the unknown! Ultimately, your escape depends on your wits, your raft, and the hidden knowledge of the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you make your way back home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Lost and shipwrecked in the Bermuda Triangle, forge your path across an infinite archipelago. Discover hidden treasures, recruit a loyal crew, and uncover secrets as you try to make your way back home.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/8f74992b7b368d69ce2c1d440b428f98b1ffa557/header.jpg?t=1785003939", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/f49f85d1258855ba4406619f04317e23841bef78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785003939", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838200/f49f85d1258855ba4406619f04317e23841bef78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=